 checkVersion;ver
 ⍝ Check DuckDB version

 :If 0=⎕NC'null'
     init 'C:\Users\kimmo\duckdb-dyalog\lib\'
 :EndIf

 ⎕←'Getting DuckDB version...'
 ver←version ⍬
 ⎕←'DuckDB Version: ',ver
 ⎕←''
 ⎕←'This implementation requires DuckDB v0.8.0 or later for bind functions.'
 ⎕←'If your version is older, prepared statements with binding may not work.'

⍝ KSL 1.0.0
